      },
      "seed_int": 0,
      "title": "Godot 4 Standard export",
      "text": "Export with File > Export material > Godot > Godot 4 Standard, or tools/materials/export.py, into data/models/board/textures, then use Reload assets. The PNG8 encoders keep exact byte codes; the nodes after them only undo what the Material node applies on export (normal convention, heightmap = 1 - depth).",
      "size": {
        "x": 760,
        "y": 150
      },
